WEBVTT

00:14:26.182 --> 00:14:30.080
Justice Ginsberg said something like --

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:35.496
every constitution that's been written
since the end of World War II

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:40.496
included a provision that made women
citizens of equal stature,

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.216
but ours does not.

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:44.136
So that would be a good place to start.

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:46.216
Very, very mild --

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:47.456
JF: Right.

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:48.680
(Applause)

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.856
And gender equality, it's like a tide,

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:54.816
it would lift all boats, not just women.

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:57.376
PM: Needing new role models
on how to do that.

00:14:57.400 --> 00:14:58.816
How to be friends,

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:01.736
how to think about our power
in different ways,